{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:00Z","created_by_operation":"op_622df7aed7584006b02a904d5b42cb09","id":"pg_b46e8c86f8c05be693c63b6f2fbe76c5","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/qwenlm-qwen-code-docs-users-features-sandbox-md-7e0beb9d1823-3b6f2fbe76c5.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_b2a5690c3f145707bb9b60345a7e84b3"],"title":"QwenLM/qwen-code/docs/users/features/sandbox.md @ 7e0beb9d1823","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:00Z","updated_by_operation":"op_622df7aed7584006b02a904d5b42cb09"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_087625134d58de08f29b7d6db36d59d42238b63c6209f66d7963572e6ca75ff6"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"NPM installation requires Node.js 22+; the project was originally based on Google Gemini CLI v0.8.2 but stopped syncing upstream starting from Qwen Code v0.1."},{"claim_ids":["clm_110a3814d4d12db7b301a02be5711930193930f1730ac15a4b35f6e90ddcae23"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: contributions are directed to CONTRIBUTING.md for guidelines."},{"claim_ids":["clm_254bea1c00a829fc129a389f13de362f4c10ee854fbfdd18b64958c24034b408"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The product offers multiple invocation surfaces: an interactive `qwen` TUI started in a project directory, headless `qwen -p \"...\"` for scripts/CI, and an experimental `qwen serve` daemon exposing HTTP + SSE (ACP)."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5e578832269ca9d7a4f80cefa8da12ade2d771e104b97f986b1ab9a323cbda68"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Inside a session, `/auth` configures the provider and API key; the CLI is started by running `qwen` in a project directory."},{"claim_ids":["clm_8e0cb7db4b61a63442af47fb149dede015d4c3bfecf21cc08189cabeb5a57040"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The agent supports multiple model protocols — OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, and Qwen APIs — plus third-party or local providers (Ollama/vLLM), switchable at runtime."},{"claim_ids":["clm_cda91ac3d6e68c0fe48d71a3c99e331cf3416a0f6c067eb357cdfd29248ae0c2"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The README reports a SWE-bench Verified evaluation (500 cases, 3 trials per version, model Qwen 3.7 Max) with average scores between roughly 76.4% and 77.8% across seven Qwen Code versions."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d93e84acb57184c6b602b37a0466ed377676b55cf30dc20766760a81754e90d4"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Qwen Code is positioned as an open-source AI coding agent for terminal, editor, desktop, browser, and chat, aiming for feature parity with Claude Code plus multi-protocol and daemon-mode extras."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ea38d7ebb4fdafa5771e94f673c8eb20e4362289e183ac1bb1dd18d6796e71de"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"SDKs exist for TypeScript, Python, and Java; the Python SDK exposes an async `query()` taking a cwd and path to the qwen executable, streaming messages from which result messages are printed."}],"claim_ids":["clm_087625134d58de08f29b7d6db36d59d42238b63c6209f66d7963572e6ca75ff6","clm_110a3814d4d12db7b301a02be5711930193930f1730ac15a4b35f6e90ddcae23","clm_254bea1c00a829fc129a389f13de362f4c10ee854fbfdd18b64958c24034b408","clm_5e578832269ca9d7a4f80cefa8da12ade2d771e104b97f986b1ab9a323cbda68","clm_8e0cb7db4b61a63442af47fb149dede015d4c3bfecf21cc08189cabeb5a57040","clm_cda91ac3d6e68c0fe48d71a3c99e331cf3416a0f6c067eb357cdfd29248ae0c2","clm_d93e84acb57184c6b602b37a0466ed377676b55cf30dc20766760a81754e90d4","clm_ea38d7ebb4fdafa5771e94f673c8eb20e4362289e183ac1bb1dd18d6796e71de"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:00Z","created_by_operation":"op_622df7aed7584006b02a904d5b42cb09","id":"pg_d3d4c321184153ab8be42cc033c8b95f","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/qwenlm-qwen-code-readme-md-7e0beb9d1823-2cc033c8b95f.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_0223cfa9e0ba5300ab46d42e77375e48"],"title":"QwenLM/qwen-code/README.md @ 7e0beb9d1823","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:34:00Z","updated_by_operation":"op_622df7aed7584006b02a904d5b42cb09"}
